{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LARGE Little: A Tiny Man's Story</strong> invites you into Tony\u2019s seemingly ordinary garden, brimming with imagination. From a first-person (FPS) perspective, you\u2019ll step into this miniature world, meet both friendly and hostile animals, complete the tasks they give you, and form unforgettable bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this garden, every corner hides something to discover: secret passages, little mysteries, and the small wonders of everyday life. As your journey unfolds, each step will lead you to new discoveries\u2014about both yourself and the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this journey:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bond with animal friends</strong> \u2013 take on quests, lend a hand, or escape from those who pose a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the garden</strong> \u2013 a world full of secret paths, tiny mysteries, and surprising encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story, quests and progression system</strong> \u2013 As the story unfolds, earn rewards and grow through new quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living environment</strong> \u2013 the garden is not just a backdrop, but a vibrant world that responds to your presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner holds experiences that are both fun and thought-provoking.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952360?t=1772392250","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/9429d6214d3282ecdacd827f61becf4b69d49f34/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772392250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/ef98f765b027e0d57d84814a9c5e8c471fcf99a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772392250","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952360/ef98f765b027e0d57d84814a9c5e